### [Prior Hint Applied]
- Replaced fragile quadratic slack penalty with bounded `tanh`-based urgency (soft positive gain + hard negative penalty), improving deadline-sensitive prioritization stability.  
- Introduced explicit `slack_clip_upper`/`slack_clip_upper_pos` parameters to constrain nonlinear urgency, preventing outlier-driven over-penalization.  
- Added `duration_fairness` term using `abs(norm_duration)` to penalize duration extremes—reducing bias toward only short or only long tasks without coupling to uncertainty.

